{"title": "Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill (Condition)", "pageid": 24699, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal's_Power_Word_Kill_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Chant Bhaal's Power Word Kill Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>As part of the challenge to enter the temple, the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Farslayer</a> has begun chanting. It can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/30px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/40px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\">Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a> once its profane ritual ends. Exiting the Farslayer's chanting range of 55 m (183 ft) makes its enemies invulnerable to the effect. Slaying the Farslayer stops the ritual and wins the conflict. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Aside from killing the Farslayer, the ritual can also be interrupted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silencing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silencing</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunning</a>, or knocking him <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. More generally, inflicting any condition from the following groups will also interrupt the ritual:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unconscious_(status_group)\" title=\"Unconscious (status group)\">Unconscious (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fleeing_(status_group)\" title=\"Fleeing (status group)\">Fleeing (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(status_group)\" title=\"Petrified (status group)\">Petrified (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(status_group)\" title=\"Stunned (status group)\">Stunned (status group)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone (status group)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal.27s_Power_Word_Kill\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal's_Power_Word_Kill\">Sources of Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/30px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/45px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/60px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/30px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\">Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Creatures_with_Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal.27s_Power_Word_Kill\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal's_Power_Word_Kill\">Creatures with Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/30px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/45px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/60px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ghislev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/30px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LOW_BHAALTEMPLE_RITUALCHANNEL</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Bloody_Favour\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Favour_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloody Favour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloody Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Favour_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloody Favour (Condition)\">Bloody Favour</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Bhaal's Chosen will be granted a profane boon at the start of every turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal's_Power_Word_Kill\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Chant:_Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ritual Chant: Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>As part of the challenge to enter the temple, the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Farslayer</a> has begun chanting. It can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/30px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/40px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/20px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\">Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a> once its profane ritual ends. Exiting the Farslayer's chanting range of 55 m (183 ft) makes its enemies invulnerable to the effect. Slaying the Farslayer stops the ritual and wins the conflict.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/25px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/38px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/50px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_